PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
20-turn game. LavenousCAM's Foxparks/Rooby chip-attacked Beicon early (10->9->8->7, several Lucky Pal cancels), but Beicon's Jormuntide (1600) destroyed LavenousCAM's Mounted Machine Gun, Rooby, and Suzaku across turns 7-12 via combat. Beicon built a Grappling Gun/Pengullet Rocket Launcher soul engine and ground LavenousCAM down with repeated Jormuntide direct attacks (3 dmg each turn), two of which were nullified by LavenousCAM's Bushi/Foxparks interrupts (turns 14, 17) and one cancelled by Lucky Pal (turn 18). LavenousCAM's Jormuntide Ignis attack was bare-form interrupted by Beicon's Cryolinx (turn 19). Beicon closed with two more Jormuntide hits for 3 each (4 to 1 to 0, turn 20).


